  "prefLabel": "Env-A 625.03 Written Notification Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 625.03 Written Notification Required. An owner or operator electing to comply with this part shall send a written notification to the department stating their intention to operate under the emission caps established in this part, including a statement that the facility has determined that the stationary source, area source or device does not meet any of the applicability thresholds in accordance with Env-A 607.01.\n\nSource. #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a600.html"
